| Build | ms |
|---|---|
| the Spring stand-ins | 607.6 |
| before | 396.6 |
| after | 418.8 |
| offset | 397.8 |
| unrelated-edit | 396.3 |
| helper-rewrite | 395.4 |

## Repeated stages, one by one

| Stage | ms |
|---|---|
| decoding every class file of the old build (4 files, 4988 bytes) | 0.04 |
| relocating the old build into package before/ (each proof does once) | 0.18 |
| loading both builds for alignment (compare does once) | 0.12 |
| aligning the two builds (compare does once) | 0.26 |
| reading both builds' entry points' observation specs (compare does once) | 0.95 |
| opening the JDK's image the first time in a process, its table of classes built, writing the copy of its index included (each open did before R3's cache) | 8.63 |
| opening the JDK's image again, its table shared (each class path with the JDK does: several per proof) | 0.07 |
| writing the models' 17 class files into a work directory (each proof does once, after its lookup) | 0.38 |
| the models' digest (each claim key takes it) | 0.12 |
| the binary's digest (12926816 bytes; once per process) | 37.69 |

